{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gitDiffEnableFastUntrackedDirs","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GitDiffOptionT","preciseIdentifier":"s:12SwiftLibgit214GitDiffOptionTV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffOptionT"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The normal Git behavior is to scan the entire content of an untracked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directory. If all the content of an untracked directory is ignored,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then the directory is labeled as ignored. If any of the content is not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignored, then the directory is labeled as untracked.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This flag indicates that the scan should not be performed, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"untracked directories should be immediately labeled as untracked.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftlibgit2\/gitdiffoptiont\/gitdiffenablefastuntrackeddirs"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffOptionT\/gitDiffEnableFastUntrackedDirs"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"swift-libgit2"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property","title":"gitDiffEnableFastUntrackedDirs","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gitDiffEnableFastUntrackedDirs","kind":"i